WEBVTT

00:00:03.060 --> 00:00:06.700
Iden: I have an idea. You're not gonna like it.

00:00:13.740 --> 00:00:19.260
Iden: Okay. We’ll meet you at the tower. Until then, you stay out of sight. That new paint job will give you away.

00:00:19.320 --> 00:00:20.940
Droid: **(Beeps)**

00:00:24.100 --> 00:00:27.040
Iden: Well, don’t just stand there, soldier. Let's get a move-on.
